      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently appreciate that training sessions are tailored to specific canine personalities, breed traits, and energy levels. Pet parents report that instructors work effectively with reactive rescues, high-energy working dogs, and shy puppies. Reviewers highlight thoughtful dog pairings and small group sizes that keep dogs focused and engaged throughout exercises."
