      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners report significant, tangible progress in their pets' behavior across Puppy Elementary, Canine High School, and specialized nosework courses. Multiple reviewers note that nervous dogs gained confidence in urban environments, while energetic pups learned reliable impulse control. Clients value structured curricula that provide clear homework exercises for lasting progress."
      }
